      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Iterate on an approved concept\n\nThis is the chain. The **Load** node pulls a Version back out of Flow PT, the graph works on it, and\nthe **Publish** node files the result as the next Version.\n\n**Nothing is typed to make that connection.** The new Version records\n**sg_ai_generated_from** pointing at the one it was built from, because the Load node is upstream in\nthis graph. Follow the lineage in Flow PT and you can walk a frame back to the concept it came from.\n\nRun 01 first so there is a concept to pull. The Load node takes the newest whose name contains\n**concept**; narrow it further with statuses if your show approves before iterating.\n\n**denoise** is how far from the original this goes: 0.4 refines, 0.8 reinvents."
      ]
    },
